  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 902.18 NH stream crossing guidelines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 902.18 “NH stream crossing guidelines” means the New Hampshire Stream Crossing Guidelines published by the University of New Hampshire dated May 2009, which can be downloaded for free at https://www.des.nh.gov/sites/g/files/ehbemt341/files/documents/2020-01/lrm-unh-stream-crossing.pdf.\n\nSource. #12809, eff 12-15-19",
